    {
      "ea": "0x989d0",
      "comment": "ORIGINAL BUG (bugs.tsv): this compare can never be true-to-branch here. TransferScreen_Draw returns at 0x98224 unless bTransferPanelsBuilt @ 0x1870EC is set, and Base_HitTestFacilityStrip @ 0x671B0 disables the strip on that same byte -- forcing a miss that returns nSelectedBaseIdx, the value in var_6C (stored at 0x984D8 from the second argument, which Geoscape_Draw loads from abFacilityGrid + 0x619 at 0x93EA8). So the NE at 0x989D4 never fires, byte_1870F8 is never cleared here, and the store at 0x98994 pins the transfer destination byte_1870F4 to the source base on every overlay frame."
    }
  ],
